{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <h5><strong>5. \u306a-A\u3067\u3057\u305f\uff08\u306a\u3051\u3044\u3088\u3046\u3057\u306e\u904e\u53bb\u5f62\uff09<\/strong><\/h5><p>&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:52.75%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><ul><li><p>\u3053\u306e\u307f\u305b \u306f\u3000\u3059\u3066\u304d\u3067\u3059\u3002&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp; (C\u1eeda h\u00e0ng n\u00e0y th\u1eadt tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u3080\u304b\u3057\u3000\u3053\u306e\u307e\u3061\u306f\u3000\u3057\u305a\u304b\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002<\/p><p>(Ng\u00e0y x\u01b0a th\u1ecb tr\u1ea5n n\u00e0y r\u1ea5t y\u00ean t\u0129nh.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h6><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u><\/h6><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t th\u00ec <u>Qu\u00e1 kh\u1ee9<\/u> c\u1ee7a t\u00ednh t\u1eeb \u0111u\u00f4i \u306a<\/p><h6><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u><\/h6><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:53.32%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:18.89%;\"><col style=\"width:38.75%;\"><col style=\"width:42.36%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>A\uff08\u306a\uff09<\/strong><\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i\/T\u01b0\u01a1ng lai<\/strong><\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Qu\u00e1 kh\u1ee9<\/strong><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">K\u0110<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">A<s><strong>\u306a<\/strong><\/s>\u3067\u3059<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">A<s><strong>\u306a<\/strong><\/s>\u3067\